OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 23 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GA showcase of great performances
OL,11,     Gfrom the UK and abroad, including
OL,12,     GCzech masterpieces and live music-
OL,13,     Gmaking from Wigmore Hall from
OL,14,     Gpianists Pavel Kolesnikov and
OL,15,     GSamson Tsoy.
