OL,17,     GDonald Macleod talks to Thomas
OL,18,     GAdes about the music that first
OL,19,     Gpropelled him to stardom, while
OL,20,     Gstill in his twenties, the
OL,21,     Gcomposer's first opera, Powder
OL,22,     GHer Face.
